d 'POWER_ONEMEAN_RTM': module to compute power for a regression to the mean-adjusted one-sample mean test
d
d  onemean_rtm computes power for a pre-post study to detect the
d portion of the anticipated effect that cannot be explained by
d regression to the mean (RTM). 
d
d KW: regression to the mean
d KW: power
d KW: one sample
d
d Requires: Stata version 11
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260820
d
d Author: Ariel Linden, Linden Consulting Group, LLC
d Support: email alinden@@lindenconsulting.org
d
f power_cmd_onemean_rtm.ado
f power_cmd_onemean_rtm_init.ado
f power_onemean_rtm.sthlp
